{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_03D250","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"是那片<R=居住区,BARRACKS>吗。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=居住区,BARRACKS>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":37,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"那里结构复杂，视野很差。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"正适合潜入。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"也许吧，但也很容易弄不清自己现在的位置。而且拐弯时还可能和敌人撞个正着……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"嗯，我会小心。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"爬到屋顶上视野会好一些，但当然也更容易被发现，而且没多少地方能藏。真要上去，就别停留太久。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":135,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"迅速把地形侦察清楚。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"那里的警卫没有适合远距离射击的武器。大概是地形造成的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"带上狙击步枪的话，也许能占些优势。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"狙击步枪吗，明白了。我会考虑。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"加油，Snake。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":17,"review_flag":""}]}